{"id":"f395ad0cda384617","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton.md","title":"有向回路到无向回路的三顶点构造","display":"thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton — 有向回路到无向回路的三顶点构造","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton","aliases":["73-thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton"],"display":"thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton — 有向回路到无向回路的三顶点构造","depends_on":["[[73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.5, print pp. 471–473; PDF pp. 493–495; explicit standard three-vertex construction","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton — 有向回路到无向回路的三顶点构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5866f606e95cdcc\" href=\"?note=d5866f606e95cdcc\" title=\"73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages\">73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.5, print pp. 471–473; PDF pp. 493–495; explicit standard three-vertex construction"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\">\\(\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E&#39;\">\\(E&#39;\\)</span> 由下式定义；每个 v 被三个顶点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"3v,3v+1,3v+2\">\\(3v,3v+1,3v+2\\)</span> 代替。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E&#39;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\in V_n}\\{\\{3v,3v+1\\},\\{3v+1,3v+2\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\{3v+2,3u\\}:(v,u)\\in E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E&#39;\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\in V_n}\\{\\{3v,3v+1\\},\\{3v+1,3v+2\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\{3v+2,3u\\}:(v,u)\\in E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GCode}^D(n,E)\\in\\mathsf{DHC}\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{GCode}^U(3n,E&#39;)\\in\\mathsf{UHC}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GCode}^D(n,E)\\in\\mathsf{DHC}\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{GCode}^U(3n,E&#39;)\\in\\mathsf{UHC}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>中间点度数为二，任何 Hamilton 圈必须连续走完三点链。外连边只从“出”端接到另一个“入”端，所以圈上的链方向全体一致，整体反向也只改变读圈方向。压缩各链恢复有向 Hamilton 圈；反向展开直接成立。图大小仅乘常数，矩阵码长度也只乘常数阶。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages","status":"resolved","id":"d5866f606e95cdcc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-hamilton-cycle-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{DGraph}(n,E)","display":false},{"tex":"E'","display":false},{"tex":"3v,3v+1,3v+2","display":false},{"tex":"E'\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{v\\in V_n}\\{\\{3v,3v+1\\},\\{3v+1,3v+2\\}\\}\n\\cup\\{\\{3v+2,3u\\}:(v,u)\\in E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GCode}^D(n,E)\\in\\mathsf{DHC}\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{GCode}^U(3n,E')\\in\\mathsf{UHC}.","display":true}],"bytes":1516,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-272","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-directed-to-undirected-hamilton|有向回路到无向回路的三顶点构造]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"f6386d790ff0500e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["d5866f606e95cdcc"]}